# "Concrete Jungle" — Jungle / DnB
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 170
swing 5
steps 32
kit 808

# Master
reverb 0.20
delay 0.30
enhancer 0.35
width 1.15

# Breakbeat
kick     "x..x....x..x..x.x..x....x..x..x."
snare    "....x..+....x.......x..+....x..."
hh       "x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x."
oh       ".......x...............x........"

# Euclidean percussion
euclidean perc 7 32
euclidean rim 5 32

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.90
vol snare 0.80
vol hh 0.40
vol perc 0.25
vol rim 0.20
pan perc 0.30
pan rim -0.30
dist kick 0.10
sendverb snare 0.15
senddly oh 0.40

# Heavy sub bass
scale C minor
note "C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ Eb1 ~ F1 ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
